Cell[TextData[{
 "In the interior region, the situation is more complicated due to the \
coupling.  It turns out that it is still possible to solve the problem \
exactly.  The trick is to use \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]dressed\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] states that are eigenstates of the constant matrix \
(assume ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["g", TraditionalForm]]],
 " is real):"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.69150528489655*^9, 3.691505339447569*^9}, {
  3.691505438178183*^9, 3.691505442730088*^9}}],

